=== TITLE: Digital X-Ray - Hip Joint (AP & Lateral Views) ===
=== IMPRESSION ===
NORMAL DIGITAL RADIOGRAPH OF HIP JOINT (AP & LATERAL VIEWS).
- Preserved articular joint space and normal bony alignment.
- No evidence of fracture, dislocation, osteonecrosis, or arthritic changes.

=== FINDINGS ===
STUDY: DIGITAL RADIOGRAPH OF HIP JOINT (AP & LATERAL VIEWS)

FINDINGS:
- BONY ARCHITECTURE: Acetabulum, femoral head, neck, and proximal shaft show normal bony density, trabecular pattern, and cortical continuity.
- JOINT SPACE: Femoroacetabular joint space is well-maintained symmetrically. No joint space narrowing, subchondral sclerosis, or osteophytes.
- ALIGNMENT: Shenton's line and iliofemoral lines are continuous and intact without disruption.
- SOFT TISSUES: Periarticular soft tissue planes appear normal. No pathological calcification or ossification noted.